<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Provisional architecture feedback</title><style>body{font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;background:#f4f3ed;color:#17313e;margin:0}main{max-width:1250px;padding:24px;margin:auto}.notice{padding:16px;border-left:5px solid #ae553f;background:white}.scroll{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;background:white;width:100%;min-width:850px}td,th{border:1px solid #cbd0cd;padding:10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{color:#12667a}@media(max-width:650px){main{padding:12px}}</style><main><h1>Provisional architecture feedback</h1><p class="notice">Changed vehicle mass and spacing propagate into axle patterns, civil demand, full-module platforms, braking and lifting sensitivities. No architecture, load, material, supplier configuration or manufacturing release is accepted.</p><p>12 architecture cases; 193 distinct beam geometries; 2316 response records. Local sampled screens do not complete a structure or railway.</p><p><a href="report.json">Whole report and open gates</a> · <a href="mechanical.json">Mechanical variants / mass equilibrium</a> · <a href="equipment.json">British equipment cases</a> · <a href="architecture-demands.csv">Demand CSV</a> · <a href="beam-family.json">Beam geometry family</a></p><p>LM3 uses three 16.5 m cars and 12 axles. The separate planning train uses six 18.5 m cars and 24 axles. No LM3 steel addition is transferred into the six-car case. Six-car 460.8 t is an independent +20% mass sensitivity.</p><p>A 116 m platform includes a partial module: it is not 20 complete 6 m modules. This study reserves complete modules; site, egress and detailed interfaces stay open.</p><p><a href="architecture-layout.svg">Train / axle / full-module platform diagram</a></p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Architecture demand</th><th>Full-module platform</th><th>80km/h translational stop</th><th>Civil variations</th><th>Acceptance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>lm3-source-reference<br>LM3</td><td>49.500 m<br>105.750 t<br>12 axles</td><td>9 × 6 m = 54 m</td><td>26.111 MJ<br>105.750 kN</td><td><a href="cases/lm3-source-reference/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-d64a8821a7b1, arch-civil-7ca112c22f45<br>72/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 106.186 t; service minimum 0.343 MPa; 72/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 106.186 t; service minimum 0.343 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>lm3-gap-1p8<br>LM3</td><td>53.100 m<br>105.750 t<br>12 axles</td><td>10 × 6 m = 60 m</td><td>26.111 MJ<br>105.750 kN</td><td><a href="cases/lm3-gap-1p8/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-8624725b0aaa, arch-civil-d64a8821a7b1<br>72/96 actual lower strands; bed 14.784 MN; hook 105.811 t; service minimum 0.801 MPa; 72/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 106.186 t; service minimum 1.441 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>lm3-gap-2p0<br>LM3</td><td>53.500 m<br>105.750 t<br>12 axles</td><td>10 × 6 m = 60 m</td><td>26.111 MJ<br>105.750 kN</td><td><a href="cases/lm3-gap-2p0/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-8624725b0aaa, arch-civil-d64a8821a7b1<br>72/96 actual lower strands; bed 14.784 MN; hook 105.811 t; service minimum 0.918 MPa; 72/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 106.186 t; service minimum 1.558 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>lm3-gap-1p8-frame-750x25<br>LM3</td><td>53.100 m<br>149.141 t<br>12 axles</td><td>10 × 6 m = 60 m</td><td>36.825 MJ<br>149.141 kN</td><td><a href="cases/lm3-gap-1p8-frame-750x25/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-f1ed655d5ff8, arch-civil-5dd98dd795bb<br>64/96 actual lower strands; bed 14.784 MN; hook 119.233 t; service minimum 0.031 MPa; 64/96 actual lower strands; bed 14.784 MN; hook 119.233 t; service minimum 0.031 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>lm3-gap-2p0-frame-750x25<br>LM3</td><td>53.500 m<br>149.141 t<br>12 axles</td><td>10 × 6 m = 60 m</td><td>36.825 MJ<br>149.141 kN</td><td><a href="cases/lm3-gap-2p0-frame-750x25/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-f1ed655d5ff8, arch-civil-5dd98dd795bb<br>64/96 actual lower strands; bed 14.784 MN; hook 119.233 t; service minimum 0.142 MPa; 64/96 actual lower strands; bed 14.784 MN; hook 119.233 t; service minimum 0.142 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>lm3-gap-1p8-lighter-built-up-i<br>LM3</td><td>53.100 m<br>124.118 t<br>12 axles</td><td>10 × 6 m = 60 m</td><td>30.646 MJ<br>124.118 kN</td><td><a href="cases/lm3-gap-1p8-lighter-built-up-i/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-ea745a1ebfb8, arch-civil-dc2f2dcdc28b<br>80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 106.186 t; service minimum 0.231 MPa; 80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 106.186 t; service minimum 0.231 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>planning-six-car-384000kg-cg-0.5<br>metro-6car-planning</td><td>111.000 m<br>384.000 t<br>24 axles</td><td>20 × 6 m = 120 m</td><td>94.815 MJ<br>384.000 kN</td><td><a href="cases/planning-six-car-384000kg-cg-0.5/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-483da4ed2cc1, arch-civil-b7b7a8f84f33<br>80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 119.607 t; service minimum 0.057 MPa; 80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 119.607 t; service minimum 0.057 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>planning-six-car-384000kg-cg0<br>metro-6car-planning</td><td>111.000 m<br>384.000 t<br>24 axles</td><td>20 × 6 m = 120 m</td><td>94.815 MJ<br>384.000 kN</td><td><a href="cases/planning-six-car-384000kg-cg0/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-483da4ed2cc1, arch-civil-b7b7a8f84f33<br>80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 119.607 t; service minimum 0.341 MPa; 80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 119.607 t; service minimum 0.341 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>planning-six-car-384000kg-cg0.5<br>metro-6car-planning</td><td>111.000 m<br>384.000 t<br>24 axles</td><td>20 × 6 m = 120 m</td><td>94.815 MJ<br>384.000 kN</td><td><a href="cases/planning-six-car-384000kg-cg0.5/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-483da4ed2cc1, arch-civil-b7b7a8f84f33<br>80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 119.607 t; service minimum 0.057 MPa; 80/112 actual lower strands; bed 17.248 MN; hook 119.607 t; service minimum 0.057 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>planning-six-car-460800kg-cg-0.5<br>metro-6car-planning</td><td>111.000 m<br>460.800 t<br>24 axles</td><td>20 × 6 m = 120 m</td><td>113.778 MJ<br>460.800 kN</td><td><a href="cases/planning-six-car-460800kg-cg-0.5/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-ebbcc7d34af7, arch-civil-fca4db523297<br>112/144 actual lower strands; bed 22.176 MN; hook 120.356 t; service minimum 0.993 MPa; 112/144 actual lower strands; bed 22.176 MN; hook 120.356 t; service minimum 0.993 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>planning-six-car-460800kg-cg0<br>metro-6car-planning</td><td>111.000 m<br>460.800 t<br>24 axles</td><td>20 × 6 m = 120 m</td><td>113.778 MJ<br>460.800 kN</td><td><a href="cases/planning-six-car-460800kg-cg0/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-ebbcc7d34af7, arch-civil-fca4db523297<br>112/144 actual lower strands; bed 22.176 MN; hook 120.356 t; service minimum 1.334 MPa; 112/144 actual lower strands; bed 22.176 MN; hook 120.356 t; service minimum 1.334 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr><tr><td>planning-six-car-460800kg-cg0.5<br>metro-6car-planning</td><td>111.000 m<br>460.800 t<br>24 axles</td><td>20 × 6 m = 120 m</td><td>113.778 MJ<br>460.800 kN</td><td><a href="cases/planning-six-car-460800kg-cg0.5/civil.json">All beam responses</a><br>arch-civil-ebbcc7d34af7, arch-civil-fca4db523297<br>112/144 actual lower strands; bed 22.176 MN; hook 120.356 t; service minimum 0.993 MPa; 112/144 actual lower strands; bed 22.176 MN; hook 120.356 t; service minimum 0.993 MPa</td><td>Open</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>Native geometry checks</h2><p><a href="models/LM3/arch-civil-f1ed655d5ff8/model.FCStd">lm3-gap-2p0-frame-750x25</a> · <a href="models/metro-6car-planning/arch-civil-ebbcc7d34af7/model.FCStd">planning-six-car-460800kg-cg0.5</a></p><p>Reopened FCStd/STEP geometry does not qualify material resistance, reinforcement, stressing equipment or manufacture.</p><h2>Remaining acceptance gates</h2><ul><li>Approved axle masses, CGs, articulated support and railway load combinations</li><li>Source architecture adoption, complete mass closure including gangways/services and gauging</li><li>Track/platform/site geometry, egress and partial/full-module interface design</li><li>Material limits, losses, reinforcement, end zones, dynamics, fatigue and full structural load path</li><li>Offered crane, jack, strand, stressing head, mould, bed and foundation configurations</li><li>Issued production information, physical trials and independent design acceptance</li></ul><p>British supplier sources establish catalogue leads only. No supplier is contacted. Earlier source-bound packets remain historical evidence.</p></main></html>